1e:["$","p",null,{"children":["Chromium's Siso config takes its remote platform properties from\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"build/config/siso/backend_config/backend.star"}]," (copy ",["$","code",null,{"children":"template.star"}],"\nand edit it, or point the ",["$","code",null,{"children":"reapi_backend_config_path"}]," gclient custom\nvar at your own file). Each platform entry names an ",["$","code",null,{"children":"OSFamily"}]," and a\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"container-image"}],", and every Forge worker that should run Chromium\nactions must advertise the same values, with the property key spelled\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"container-image"}]," (hyphen)."]}]
